usage: install.py [-h] --prefix PREFIX [--configuration {Release,Debug}]
                  [--build-dir BUILD_DIR] [--jobs JOBS]

Build and install VOID from this checkout using its existing pinned recipes.
Prepare platform prerequisites first: docs/install/README.md. No sudo, system
package installation, shell profile changes or binary packaging is performed.

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --prefix PREFIX       Installation directory (use a user-owned prefix)
  --configuration {Release,Debug}
  --build-dir BUILD_DIR
                        Separate CMake build directory; default
                        build/source-<configuration>
  --jobs JOBS           Parallel build jobs (default 3)
